# VHS recording for the README overview
Output examples/vhs/generated/overview.gif

Set Theme "Aardvark Blue"
Set Width 890
Set Height 460
Set Padding 30
Set Framerate 25

Hide
Type "target/release/examples/readme overview"
Enter
Wait+Screen /Linear/
Show
Sleep 1s
Screenshot target/vhs/overview.png
Sleep 6s
